{"candidateAnswer":"That community involvement strengthens bonds and brings people together in meaningful ways","evidence":"[D2:3 | 1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023] Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! The event was really thought-provoking. I'm starting to realize that self-care is really important. It's a journey for me, but when I look after myself, I'm able to better look after my family.","itemId":"urn:uuid:61e1876c-04fd-5065-a289-1a10525bd293","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a3c5d60c34d2bfe8c19aed1b08f9a1814420a72ea54e2983fc1fd30fadeb19df","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Melanie realize after the charity race?","referenceAnswer":"self-care is important","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a3c5d60c34d2bfe8c19aed1b08f9a1814420a72ea54e2983fc1fd30fadeb19df"}}]}